            <ArticleTitle>The role of Th1/Th2 polarization in mucosal immunity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>567-73</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Mucosal immunity relies on the delicate balance between antigen responsiveness and tolerance. The polarization of T helper cells plays a key role in maintaining or disrupting this equilibrium.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
